FR:
On dirait qu'{{TAG:000E:0006:040069006C00080065006C006C006500}} est vraiment pas
là...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} C'est trop dommage ! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}J'ai plus
qu'à rentrer chez moi...{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} mi sa proprio che non c'è
nessuno! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Uffa, me ne tornerò
a casa...{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Menno, sieht aus, als wär niemand
zu Hause. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Echt schade!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich geh wohl einfach heim...{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

ES:
Pasar el rato sol{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} es superaburrido.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
¿No prefieres pasarlo con alguien
tan chupi como yo?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je dérange pas, j'espère ! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Hi hi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je
pensais à toi, alors je me suis dit...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Autant aller {{TAG:000E:0006:04006C00650004006C006100}} voir !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I bet you're thinking {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}this is,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} like,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
the nicest surprise you've ever
gotten!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} And you'd {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}totally be right!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şu an {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}bunun,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
hayatının en tatlı sürprizi olduğunu
düşünüyorsundur!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ve {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}kesinlikle haklısın!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Antes de que se me olvide,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} 
déjame que te dé est{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006500020061000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Es un regalo que te hago de
todo corazón.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah! Prima che me ne dimentichi!
Ecco {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
per te!{{TAG:0003:0027:}} È un piccolo regalino!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It's a good thing I saw you today!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
I've been meaning{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} to give you {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Don't you adore getting presents
out of the blue, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bugün seni gördüğüme iyi oldu!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Sana uzun zamandır{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} vermek istiyordum!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Böyle ansızın hediye almaya
bayılmıyor musun, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Oh Mann, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}meine Manieren sind auch
nicht mehr das, was sie mal waren!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hab {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
für uns beide mitgebracht! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hau rein!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ay, terbiyem nerede? {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seninle
paylaşmak için biraz {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
getirdim! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Hadi, afiyet olsun!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Je voulais pas arriver les mains
vides, {{TAG:0003:0026:}}alors je suis venue avec {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} !
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Sers-toi,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} fais comme chez toi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}¡Para que veas que soy una buena
invitada, voy a regalarte est{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006500020061000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}C'est ton ventre que je viens
d'entendre gargouiller ? Tiens, {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}, hi hi !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Şu minicik karnında birazcık
yer vardır umarım!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Ben sana{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} getirdim!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Faut que je te laisse, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}j'ai à faire !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Je vais taper l'incruste chez
{{TAG:0005:0002:}}, hi hi !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eee, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}vakit de geldi sayılır—{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
benim{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} gitme vaktim! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Böyle
ansızın geldiğim için pardon.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Bir dahaki sefere{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sen bana
gelsene? {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Senin kadar iyi bir
ev sahibi olmaya çalışırım!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I should probably{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} be getting out of
your hair. {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Thanks for putting up{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
with a surprise guest!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Artık{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} seni rahat bırakıp gitsem iyi
olacak. {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Sürpriz bir misafire{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
katlandığın için sağ ol!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} it's been awesome seeing your
face again, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Guess it's
time for me to take off!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I'll try to give you a heads-up{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
next time I plan on dropping in.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
See you around!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir yere mi gidiyorsun? {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bu da benim
kalkmam gerektiğine{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} işaret herhâlde!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Eğlence için sağ ol, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
